xlarge-font-size\">Siap Menjadi Netizen yang Cerdas?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}},\"textColor\":\"mono-2\",\"fontSize\":\"superbfont-small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-mono-2-color has-text-color has-superbfont-small-font-size\">Mari mulai perubahan dari diri sendiri. Terapkan etika bermedia sosial sekarang juga.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|superbspacing-xsmall\"},\"layout\":{\"selfStretch\":\"fill\",\"flexSize\":null}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"backgroundColor\":\"base\",\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"fontSize\":\"superbfont-small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-base-background-color has-background has-superbfont-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"http://localhost/literasi/?page_id=16\">Baca Tips</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"fontSize\":\"superbfont-small\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-superbfont-small-font-size has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"http://localhost/literasi/?page_id=18\">Kontak Saya</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"saas-startup\",\"area\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Laman Depan', 'Menampilkan beranda situs Anda yang ditetapkan untuk menampilkan pos terbaru atau halaman statis. Templat Halaman Depan akan lebih diprioritaskan daripada semua templat lainnya.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '35-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-11-07 04:48:51', '2026-11-07 04:48:51', '', 35, 'http://localhost/literasi/?p=81', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
